  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Initial release of FlashCsv 1.0.0:\n- Ultra high-performance zero-allocation CSV reader, writer, and asynchronous streamer (IAsyncEnumerable).\n- 100% Native AOT compatible with zero runtime reflection via Roslyn incremental Source Generators.\n- Clean POCO models with no mandatory interfaces or generic constraints.\n- Advanced capabilities: nested flattening ([CsvFlatten]), JSON columns ([CsvJson]), polymorphic records ([CsvDiscriminator]), delimiter sniffing, Excel formula injection protection, string pooling, and SqlBulkCopy streaming (DbDataReader).\n- Localized XML documentation support (English and French).",
